cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Low-resource vision: nine experiments, eight of them negative"
message: "If you use these findings, please cite them."
abstract: >-
  Nine measured experiments on reducing the cost of local vision-language
  inference — byte reduction, classical pre-filters, bit-depth quantization,
  digital zoom, capture resolution, symbolic input. Eight refuted the
  hypothesis that motivated them. The single effective intervention was a
  mis-set UVC camera control.
type: dataset
